  "baselines": {
    "selfControlled": "<div class=\"local-ai-settings\" id=\"sun-data-source-section\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-primary)\">☀ Sun data source</h4>\n    <div class=\"ai-provider-desc\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">Where the Light &amp; Sun lens fetches UV, ozone, clouds, and air-quality model data. It uses your privacy-rounded home postal area or country by default. Current device location is optional, rounded locally, and kept only for today.</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\">\n      <label style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer;background:var(--bg-card);border-color:var(--accent);\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"meteo-mode\" value=\"auto\" checked data-sun-source-action=\"set-meteo-mode\" style=\"margin-top:3px\">\n    <span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-primary)\">Deployment CAMS relay</span>\n      <br><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.4\">Uses this self-hosted deployment's CAMS relay, then falls back to browser-direct Open-Meteo.</span>\n    </span>\n  </label>\n      <label style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer;\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"meteo-mode\" value=\"open-meteo\"  data-sun-source-action=\"set-meteo-mode\" style=\"margin-top:3px\">\n    <span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-primary)\">Browser-direct Open-Meteo</span>\n      <br><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.4\">Your browser sends privacy-rounded coordinates directly to Open-Meteo. getbased and Vercel do not receive them.</span>\n    </span>\n  </label>\n      <label style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer;\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"meteo-mode\" value=\"selfhost\"  data-sun-source-action=\"set-meteo-mode\" style=\"margin-top:3px\">\n    <span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-primary)\">Self-hosted server</span>\n      <br><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.4\">You run your own getbased-uvdata box. Lat/lon never leaves your infrastructure. Paste the URL + bearer below.</span>\n    </span>\n  </label>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"meteo-selfhost-fields\" style=\"margin-top:10px;display:none\">\n      <label style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted)\">Server URL</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"api-key-input\" id=\"meteo-selfhost-url\" value=\"https://meteo.example.com/plain\" placeholder=\"https://meteo.example.com\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px\" data-sun-source-action=\"save-meteo-selfhost\">\n      <label style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:8px;display:block\">Bearer token (optional)</label>\n      <input type=\"password\" class=\"api-key-input\" id=\"meteo-selfhost-bearer\" value=\"synthetic-bearer\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px\" data-sun-source-action=\"save-meteo-selfhost\" autocomplete=\"new-password\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:14px\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px\">Round location to ~11 km grid before sending<br><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted)\">Default ON. Stops the data source from seeing your exact address. Disable for slightly sharper UV math.</span></span>\n          <label class=\"toggle-switch\" style=\"margin-top:2px\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"meteo-privacy-rounding\" checked data-sun-source-action=\"toggle-meteo-rounding\">\n            <span class=\"toggle-slider\"></span>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n  </div>",
    "official": "<div class=\"local-ai-settings\" id=\"sun-data-source-section\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-primary)\">☀ Sun data source</h4>\n    <div class=\"ai-provider-desc\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">Where the Light &amp; Sun lens fetches UV, ozone, clouds, and air-quality model data. It uses your privacy-rounded home postal area or country by default. Current device location is optional, rounded locally, and kept only for today.</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\">\n      <label style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer;background:var(--bg-card);border-color:var(--accent);\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"meteo-mode\" value=\"auto\" checked data-sun-source-action=\"set-meteo-mode\" style=\"margin-top:3px\">\n    <span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-primary)\">Private CAMS relay + fallback</span>\n      <br><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.4\">Sends only ~11 km rounded coordinates and time through the fixed getbased CAMS route; falls back browser-direct to Open-Meteo.</span>\n    </span>\n  </label>\n      <label style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer;\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"meteo-mode\" value=\"open-meteo\"  data-sun-source-action=\"set-meteo-mode\" style=\"margin-top:3px\">\n    <span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-primary)\">Browser-direct Open-Meteo</span>\n      <br><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.4\">Your browser sends privacy-rounded coordinates directly to Open-Meteo. getbased and Vercel do not receive them.</span>\n    </span>\n  </label>\n      <label style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);cursor:pointer;\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"meteo-mode\" value=\"selfhost\"  data-sun-source-action=\"set-meteo-mode\" style=\"margin-top:3px\">\n    <span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-primary)\">Self-hosted server</span>\n      <br><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.4\">You run your own getbased-uvdata box. Lat/lon never leaves your infrastructure. Paste the URL + bearer below.</span>\n    </span>\n  </label>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"meteo-selfhost-fields\" style=\"margin-top:10px;display:none\">\n      <label style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted)\">Server URL</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"api-key-input\" id=\"meteo-selfhost-url\" value=\"https://meteo.example.com/plain\" placeholder=\"https://meteo.example.com\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px\" data-sun-source-action=\"save-meteo-selfhost\">\n      <label style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:8px;display:block\">Bearer token (optional)</label>\n      <input type=\"password\" class=\"api-key-input\" id=\"meteo-selfhost-bearer\" value=\"synthetic-bearer\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:4px\" data-sun-source-action=\"save-meteo-selfhost\" autocomplete=\"new-password\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:14px\"><strong>Hosted privacy boundary:</strong> location is always rounded to a ~11 km grid before CAMS or Open-Meteo requests. Exact coordinates cannot be enabled on this deployment.</div>\n  </div>"
  },
